Hi phil

Please I have a question about measurement invariance under the IRT paradigm. i've constructed a scale in a longitudinal frame (4 time-points). from exploratory mirt , the most plausible model is a three-factor model. I want to establish the validity of the scale, is it possible to follow this approach:

1- Check for the validity in each time point
2-  Then Use a MultipleGroup analysis to test fot configural, metric and scalar invariance?

Thanks a lot for your help.
Makram

